# 必考词 Unit 07 短语

## 常考短语

- **create jobs**: 创造就业 — The new factory will create hundreds of jobs. 新工厂将创造数百个就业机会。
- **take/get credit for**: 因…而得到赞扬 — She took credit for the success of the project. 她因项目的成功而受到赞扬。
- **be crucial to/for**: 对…至关重要 — Education is crucial for a country's development. 教育对国家发展至关重要。
- **cultivate a habit**: 培养习惯 — Reading is a good habit to cultivate. 阅读是一个值得培养的好习惯。
- **cure sb of**: 治愈某人的 — The doctor cured him of his illness. 医生治好了他的病。
- **out of curiosity**: 出于好奇 — She opened the box out of curiosity. 她出于好奇打开了盒子。
- **cause/do damage to**: 对…造成损害 — The earthquake caused severe damage to the city. 地震对城市造成了严重破坏。
- **debate on/about**: 就…辩论 — They debated on the issue of climate change. 他们就气候变化问题进行了辩论。
- **in the past decade**: 在过去十年中 — Technology has advanced rapidly in the past decade. 技术在过去十年中发展迅速。
- **fall into decline**: 陷入衰退 — The industry fell into decline in the 1990s. 该行业在1990年代陷入衰退。
- **dedicate...to**: 把…奉献给 — He dedicated his career to medical research. 他把职业生涯奉献给了医学研究。
- **defend...against**: 保卫…免受 — The army defended the country against invasion. 军队保卫国家免受入侵。
- **define...as**: 把…定义为 — We can define culture as a way of life. 我们可以把文化定义为一种生活方式。
- **deliberate on/upon**: 审议，仔细考虑 — The jury deliberated on the verdict. 陪审团对裁决进行了审议。
- **a matter of life and death**: 生死攸关的事 — For many patients, this is a matter of life and death. 对许多患者来说，这是生死攸关的事。
